ot-proposals/issues/954\r\n\r\nAdds navigation between recent opened scenes with mouse forward and back buttons\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI didn't manage to make keyboard shortcuts with alt+arrow work as in the script editor as various other UI parts consume any arrow key inputs beforehand. With some changes there this could be made possible. I also didn't add UI arrow buttons yet because of space considerations, but maybe it would be a a good thing.\r\n\r\nThe implementation could also be expanded in a separate pr to include node selections as history points, as e.g. seen in script editors with caret positions, if that would be desired..\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Verification</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d692ebe3-0ca2-44a4-a7e9-531a4c8a83cf\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com